 performed by C. Browne in the lab of R. Rickert, and R. Ruppert tested B cell proliferation in pan integrin-deficient mice in the lab of R. F&#x000e4;ssler. J. Cantor and M. Ginsberg wrote the manuscript with editorial input from R. Rickert and C. F&#x000e9;ral. The CD19-Cre mouse was provided by R. Rickert.</p></fn><fn id="FN3"><p>Author Information</p><p>The authors declare no competing financial interests.</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>